window.products.push({"id":220128,"name":"Howard Elliott, Round, Chocolate Brown George Mirror, 53046","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":220.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wdOkmyIGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The George Mirror features a chocolate brown finish. The round frame is made from wood and is accented with grooves for added depth and character. For more added detail the mirror features a one inch bevel. Its transitional style makes this mirror a favorite for bringing some flair to your decor. This simple yet stunning piece would be a great addition to any room. It is a perfect focal point for an entryway, bathroom, bedroom or any room in your home. D-rings are affixed to the back of the mirror so it is ready to hang right out of the box in either a horizontal or vertical orientation!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wdOkmyIGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Elliott Collection","source_asin":"B07FRCYMHG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-220128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FRCYMHG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FRCYMHG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":220129,"name":"Snowflake Christmas Tree Topper Lighted with Built-in Rotating LED Projector Glittered Snowflake Snow Treetop Projection Night Light for Christmas Tre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81goJI-uA0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create a Unique and Fantastic Christmas Wonderland for You--Look, Santa Claus, reindeer, jingle bells, Christmas trees, and snowflakes are twirling and dancing on your ceiling! The silver snowflake Christmas tree topper with built-in magic rotating LED projector, was the talk of the tree this year, super cute, awesomely sparkly, and fun! Take it home to decorate your Christmas tree, it adds so much joy, charm, and Christmas spirit to the room. Adjustable Magic Snowflake Projector--0°-180° rotatable LED projector light, the projection direction can be adjusted according to your needs. Meanwhile, the farther away from the ceiling, the larger the dynamic patterns will be. Projection Range: 3-10 square meters. Exquisite Workmanship--2022 new upgrade, clearer projection animation, richer colors, and more dynamic patterns. What’s more, the motor sound is quieter. Embellished with shiny sequins and glitter, our double-sided snowflake treetop will be shiny under the lights, beautiful and eye-catching. Made of high-quality and strong ABS material, which is durable and recyclable, you can keep it for next Christmas. 3-in-1 Multi-use Snowflake Tree Topper--The snowflake itself is very pretty on its own whether it is lit up or not. You can use it as a traditional, classic style, and non-electric treetop ornament, or plug it in as a treetop projector light. Also, not only for Christmas but also ideal as an LED night light projector for children. Your kids will love it. it can bring a lovely and cheerful atmosphere to your Christmas, suitable for home, shop, office, restaurant, bar, etc. Fits Most Christmas Trees--Size measures about 9.4 in(H) x 8.5 in(L) x 2.7 in(W), base diameter: 1.9 in, weight: 0.77 lb. Tips: Bend enough branches from the top of your tree to fit into the base. If not enough, insert a wooden stick for support or stuff it with other objects for padding, such as paper, cloth, or sponge, adjust the angle to keep it upright, then plug it in and the magic begins!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81goJI-uA0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iLitLuk","source_asin":"B0BKGTYLH5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-220129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKGTYLH5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKGTYLH5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
