window.products.push({"id":220181,"name":"StarMar Rose Gold Plastic Party Tablecloth - Use as Birthday Table Cloth, Banners, & Backdrops, Waterproof White Color Tablecloth with Rose Gold Confe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xsEex12NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HEAVY-DUTY, PREMIUM QUALITY - Protect tables and surfaces against scratches, spills, and stains with our plastic tablecloth disposable cover. All StarMar tablecloth white and black variations are waterproof and wrinkle-free. Made with premium quality PEVA plastic, each pack of premium disposable tablecloths is durable and can be used indoors or outdoors. HEAVY-DUTY, PREMIUM QUALITY - Protect tables and surfaces against scratches, spills, and stains with our plastic tablecloth disposable cover. All StarMar tablecloth white and black variations are waterproof and wrinkle-free. Made with premium quality PEVA plastic, each pack of premium disposable tablecloths is durable and can be used indoors or outdoors. MULTIPURPOSE TABLE COVER - Having a StarMar disposable tablecloth means having an instant banner, backdrop, and picnic mat in one! Our plastic party tablecloth isn't just for dinner tables. It's fancy design can be used as a door cover, wall background for pictorials, or as a banner during birthdays, weddings, or other events. PLASTIC TABLECLOTHS FOR EVENTS - Our plastic table cloths for parties disposable and decorative are the ideal table covers for any party! Lay these disposable table coverings as a birthday table cloth, thanksgiving, or themed-party tablecloths. Adorned with a classic polka dots design, these disposable plastic tablecloths suit gatherings from Sunday outdoor barbecues to wedding receptions and bridal showers. CLASSY CONFETTI DESIGN - Our plastic rectangle tablecloth comes in white and black color tablecloth decorated with Silver, Gold, and Rose Gold confetti dots. Charm your guests with these simple yet elegant table covers. Pair them with napkins and cutlery sets that exude the same vibe for a complete fancy dining experience. HASSLE-FREE CLEANING - With our durable and convenient plastic tablecloths, you can enjoy more time with your guests and less time on cleaning. After the celebration, wipe any food residue on the cover, roll, and discard. Rinse and clean any noticeable stains to use the rectangle plastic tablecloths again, then keep them in a safe place to avoid creases.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xsEex12NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"StarMar","source_asin":"B07RQX3H8L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-220181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RQX3H8L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RQX3H8L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
