window.products.push({"id":220499,"name":"Barton Set of 2 Bar Stools Beige 28.5\" Saddle Backless Premium Padded Indoor/Outdoor Nailhead Cushion Kitchen Counter Chairs Pub Seat Foot Rest","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":155.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CWZGmEGgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Bar Stool Set - The backless stools are bar Height ready and slide easily under most counters. These conveniently sized stools will make a great addition to your island or kitchen counter top, breakfast bars, and pub tables, bar stools have a leg up on other seating options Nailhead Trim - The beautiful nailhead trim adds a hint of interest and makes this stunning stool stand out in a modern living room or dining room Sturdy & Stable Rubber Frame - The frames of our bar stools are constructed of durable rubber solid wood, which allow you to use them for many years to come with 250 lbs weight capacity. These stools have non-slipped foot pads at the bottom of feet, protecting sensitive flooring and preventing it from being scratched Saddle Seat Design - The saddle-shaped stools fit in the shape of the buttocks to maintain secure, without worrying about slipping from the seats. Our stools with 28.5'' height are designed for the counters of most bars. And four pedals underneath the seat for releasing your feet and providing enough safety and stability Easy & Simple to Assemble - Pretty easy to assemble. Come with detailed instruction, steps will guide you to install these bar stools effortlessly and save much time; Each Stool Dimension: 18\"(L) x 13.5(W) x 28.5\"(H)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CWZGmEGgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Barton","source_asin":"B07G5LH2HB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-220499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G5LH2HB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G5LH2HB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":220500,"name":"Pimpernel Classic Black Collection Coasters | Set of 6 | Cork Backed Board | Heat and Stain Resistant | Drinks Coaster for Tabletop Protection | Measu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jV6QLt7FL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"INCREDIBLE ARTISTRY: Available in Black, Burgundy, Emerald, Cream, and Midnight Blue, the Classic Collection from Pimpernel features a solid background with gold edging. It is simple, yet sophisticated, pairing perfectly with any existing home or kitchen decor. STRONG AND STYLISH: Our quality placemats and coasters use a 5mm board topped with a unique and exclusive art print. Each is totally sealed with a high-quality coating that is both stain and heat resistant to 212 degrees Celsius. The placemats and coasters are then finished with a hard-wearing cork back that protects precious furniture. SOMETHING FOR EVERYONE: Pimpernel is the premier brand for placemats, coasters, trays, and accessories, with an outstanding and unique range that is renowned for its high quality. Pimpernel's exclusive homewares, textiles and gifts are created to suit all tastes, and make wonderful additions to the home. TIMELESS DESIGNS: Portmeirion was founded by legendary ceramic designer Susan William-Ellis in 1960 and has remained at the forefront of contemporary design ever since. Renowned for our tableware and giftware, Portmeirion produces beautiful and unique collections all of which are made to the highest standard to be enjoyed every day. PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS: Package contains (1) Pimpernel Classic Black Collection Coasters - Set of 6. Made of Cork-Backed Board. Each Coaster measures 4 inches x 4 inches. Product Care: Clean with a damp sponge and dry with a soft cloth. Do not immerse in water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jV6QLt7FL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pimpernel","source_asin":"B0025U1MZU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-220500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0025U1MZU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0025U1MZU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":220501,"name":"HANGERWORLD 5ft Clothes Garment Rack Cover for Open Closet Clear Showerproof Cover ONLY (60\"x24\"x57\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713Yk-hyCKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is for the garment rack COVER ONLY (Rail not included, listed separately). An excellent quality transparent cover for garment rack is made from premium PEVA plastic. This material provides a water-resistant barrier for your clothes, which is very useful when transporting your garment rack, or for outdoor retail display such as outside a clothing store or a garage sale. This plastic garment cover for a garment rack will also protect your clothes from dust, fluff and odor.You are able to clearly see through the clothes cover so you can quickly find the clothes you are looking for. While 2 access zippers, one on the left and one on the right allows easy access to each end of the clothes rack.With top quality stitching on the white trim edges, not only does this clear wardrobe cover look great in your home but it will also last a long time.If you are shopping for your business, this cover is great for commercial display. The large size means you can cover clothing racks for tops, pants, coats, and is also long enough to cover taller garments such as dresses. The bottom of the cover is open to allow air flow and prevent the cover getting caught under the wheels. There is also a large document pocket for labelling the garments hanging inside the garment cover, for displaying a pricelist and for organizing the clothes storage in your shop.This garment cover is suited to any rolling clothes rack, z rack or portable closet up to 60inches long. DIMENSIONS Size: Length x Height x Width 60 x 24 x 57.84 inch (153 x 147 x 60cm)approx. This 5ft clothing rack cover is designed by Hangerworld a trusted British brand and expert in clothing care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713Yk-hyCKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HANGERWORLD","source_asin":"B09FPM2JY5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-220501","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FPM2JY5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FPM2JY5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
