window.products.push({"id":220512,"name":"Fiumara Apparel Bib Apron, Poly Cotton Apron without Pockets use for Cooking, Baking Apron, Coffee shop, Restaurant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vspHLBtvL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Poly,Cotton Made in USA Drawstring closure machine wash MADE IN THE USA: There is nothing better than premium American made products. This unisex server apron is constructed in the United States with pride, and great attention to detail. YES, there still are garments made in the United States. DURABLE, WELL MADE: These popular bib aprons are made of high quality American 7.5 oz. 65/35 poly/cotton twill fabric. All Bib Apron fabric has a Canvas like feel for Durability. Unlike many imported products, our Fiumara aprons do not use “heat fused” tie ends, but is quality crafted by using better made “finished” tie ends. UNIQUE FABRIC: This bib apron offers appearance and function for those who prefer a classic look. With reinforced bar tacking to keep the apron held together and looking Professional, any server or chef can't go wrong with this choice. This bib Apron has stain and wrinkle resistant finish, color steadfast for vibrant colors through many wash cycles. UNISEX SIZING: This professional grade Fiumara bib apron is made for both men and women. This bib apron from Fiumara Apparel offers a basic yet classic appearance for server and chef uniforms. 28” long, 24” wide, and featuring 36” extra-long ties in the back, the apron rests around the neck with an adjustable strap. The precision cut patterns and reinforced stress points are meticulously sewn by our proud team in our USA factory. IDEAL FOR WAITSTAFF - This is a popular apron for food service workers. The apron has soil release and wrinkle resistant finish, and sturdy bar tacking at all stress points to keep your chef or server looking professional and presentable all shift long. These aprons are manufactured in USA with American fabric and are available in different colors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vspHLBtvL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fiumara Apparel","source_asin":"B07BX6Y3PR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-220512","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BX6Y3PR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BX6Y3PR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
