window.products.push({"id":220819,"name":"Mayim “The Bullet” On-the-Go Sports Water Bottle, Vacuum-Insulated Double Walled Reusable Stainless-Steel Thermos, Leakproof, Matte Coated, 17 Ounces,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bm74DHS7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Need a way to keep your beverage cold throughout the day? Mayim introduces our reusable stainless-steel water bottle, a stylish option that stands out from other bottles. This metal water bottle holds 17 oz. of water, encouraging you to hydrate throughout the day. Plus, it’s equipped with a narrow-mouth, leak proof cap. Our double-wall vacuum-insulated bottle keeps drinks cold for up to 24 hours and hot for up to 12 hours, and the super soft matte exterior makes it easy and comfortable to hold for hours while protecting your hands from sweat. With a 2.83-inch bottom width, this tumbler easily fits in most car cup holders, so it can travel with you while you run errands, head to the gym, or leave for your next vacation. This light and sturdy jug can withstand daily use as you exercise and only weighs 10.8 oz.This bottle is BPA-free and made with sturdy stainless steel and safe food-grade materials. It’s the perfect on-the-go insulated stainless-steel bottle for staying hydrated while playing tennis, hockey, soccer, or baseball or during fun outdoor workouts like hiking. Wrap up this water bottle to give to your loved ones as a fun way for them to stay hydrated while expressing their style. Find the cup you’ll love with our array of reusable tumbler options!To wash your water bottle, remove the lid to clean the inside. Wash the cup by hand in a sink, and let it dry before your next use. Do not put this item in the dishwasher or in the microwave.At Mayim, we believe in products with a purpose. Our mission is to eliminate the supply of single-use plastic one bottle at a time. All of our exclusive products are designed to be reusable and affordable. We’re committed to making it easier for parents like you to encourage your kids to be more green, starting with the water bottle they carry to school, dance, basketball practice, and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bm74DHS7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mayim","source_asin":"B0BRQQQB72","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-220819","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRQQQB72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRQQQB72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
