window.products.push({"id":220955,"name":"BCHWAY Stuffed Animal Storage Bean Bag Chair Cover for Kids Hidden Zipper Stuffie Seat for Organizing Stuffed Animal Extra Large Beanbag for Boys and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618auOTRrDL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"BCHWAY BEAN BAG COVER – BRING YOU NOT ONLY A TIDY ROOM OR COMFORTABLE LOUNGE CHAIR, BUT A MORE BEAUTIFUL AND BETTER LIFE! We know children's skin is relatively tender, so it's not suitable for prolonged contact with rough things. Our stuffed animal bean bags are made of premium velvet that is very soft and smooth. It's large enough for your kids to stuff with stuffed animals or soft fillers ( blankets, towels and bed sheets, Etc). When filled, it becomes a soft and comfy lounge chair. It's suitable for kids and adults, of course we think your dogs and cats will love it too. Treasure up your child's best memories For many little kids, stuffed animals toys always be the best friend who accompany them grow up, and these would become their precious memories. As children’s stuffed animals can easily take over their bed, bedroom, and playroom, parents always get tired of cleaning up. Now, you find a solution on how to put away your child’s stuffed animal in a useful way and keep your child's best memories! About this type of product. The stuffed animal storage bean bag chair covers are almost always have many flaws and don't actually work well. So we built our own factory and made it by ourselves. We build quality into each single BCHWY toy bean bag at every stage of product manufacturing, from product materials, hidden YKK zippers, double stitched seams to the design of the handle etc. At the same time, we can promptly improve the relevant defects reflected by buyers and adopt useful suggestions overflowed by buyers to providing buyers with more perfect products. WHAT ARE WE FOCUSING ON? DURABLE---For children, this product is equivalent to an extra-large plush toy. Any non-durable toy is vulnerable to naughty children, so almost every detail of our bean bags has been reinforced. It is difficult to damage it by children pulling it or jumping on it. COMFORTABLE---Neither children nor adults would like to lie down on an uncomfortable beanbag chair. Our bean bags are made of thick premium velvet. It feels fine, smooth and soft. At the same time, we hide the hard zipper to avoid the discomfort caused by direct contact with our skin during use. EASY TO USE AND CLEAN---Our bean bag chair cover comes with 88'' extra long two-way zipper which made it more easier to fill or take out the toys. The bean bag cover is machine washable, when you want to clean it, just put it in the washing machine. We believe our bean bag chair cover should help us maximize space, so each piece is multi-functional, giving parents a \"win win\" they deserve. SOME SUGGESTIONS FOR USING THIS BEAN BAG COVER Machine washable, dirt friendly design, hardy material and zipper means kids can play without a worry. Warm notice: Please wash the bean bag cover before the first using, machine washable and hang dry; While filling the bean bag at the beginning, it is recommended to unzip part of the zipper and then fill it. When the bean bag is filled half, then unzip all the zipper to make it fill faster and more convenient; When fill with plush toys, please put the larger and harder ones on the bottom, and the smaller and softer ones on the top. It will be better to cover a blanket on the top, which makes you feel more comfortable when sitting on it. After washing, it is recommended to dry naturally and avoid direct sunlight. We provide a lifetime warranty for your bean bag chair, so please feel free to buy, if there is any problem with this bag, please contact us at any time!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618auOTRrDL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BCHWAY","source_asin":"B0B1CVDDS4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-220955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1CVDDS4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1CVDDS4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
