window.products.push({"id":220980,"name":"Elyss Desk Fan,Small Table Fan,Air Cooler Fan with 5 LED Lights 4 Wind,Personal USB Bladeless Fan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gWxWIMt9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Safe Rechargeable Fan & USB Charging Fan It will not hurt your fingers. Children can also use it with any worry. Enjoy cool natural breeze in warm atmosphere in hot and sultry summer. USB charging (compatible with laptop, power bank, power adapter, car charger) & durable Battery is really convenient and useful. Personal Bladeless Fan With Smart Touch Button The fan allows you to enjoy coolness from gentle breeze up to a sweat-stopping wind and makes your space significantly cool. Unique touch control switch design, just need to touch gently with your finger to choose the suitable wind speed and your favorite light color. Portable Useful Fan Very lightweight & portable design,no matter where you are, it can be with you to bring coolness. This mini movable fan with colorful lights can creat a more cozy and wonderful environment to beat the heat or to improve air circulation in a stuffy space, which is a smart additon to your home & workplace. Warmest Tips Easy to clean,just simply use a damp cloth to wipe. Please insert the charging port into the correct position. Please do not press the button unless touching it to adjust modes, otherwise the button may be damaged. Different from the traditional fan blade design, this blade-less fan outputs a natural cool wind to keep you away from the sultry air. Specifications Light colors: 5 colors Size: 11.8 x 4.9 x 3.3 inch Battery capacity: 2500mAh Rated power supply: 5V-1A Rated power: 10W (max (Fan 4W¡Charging 5W)) Package Include 1 x Bladeless Fan +1x User Manual Highly Recommend A summer companion,a great cooling appliance that you can use to have better enjoyable life at anywhere anytime. A compact fan with powerful airflow can bring you a good cool feeling no matter where you are.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gWxWIMt9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elyss","source_asin":"B08CZFP1CC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-220980","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CZFP1CC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CZFP1CC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":220981,"name":"HAUTEROW Wine Storage Box Foldable Organize, 12 Bottle Carrying Case for Wine and Champagne - Red Foldable Wine Carrier","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eB0MGQUQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Foldable Wine CarrierDo you love wine and have been looking for a convenient way to store and transport your favorite bottles to take with you on vacation or to friends’ houses?Need a bottle storage case that won’t take up unnecessary room when not being used?If so, then we’ve got the perfect solution for you!Presenting ★12 Bottle Wine Carrying Case★Our foldable wine case is the ultimate high-capacity solution for quickly and easily storing and transporting up to 12 bottles of wine from your collection. Its lightweight design makes it a breeze to maneuver when the wine case is either empty or full. This 12 bottle wine case has also been expertly engineered to incredibly sturdy and durable, being able to easily hold up to 65-pounds of weight without ripping, tearing, or becoming damaged even after dozens of uses.Having been designed with tear resistant, flexible, and eco-friendly fabric material along with the bottle divider being foldable and removable as well, this portable wine carrier is able to be easily folded up when not in use, saving you precious storage space in your closet, cupboard, or car. Our collapsible bottle carrier has also been outfitted with two mesh pockets on the inside of the case, allowing you to also store and carry any small accessories along with your bottles of wine.Need more reasons to choose us?✔ This portable wine case measures 4.5L x 12.75W x 10.75H-inches when fully extended.✔ The padded ergonomic handles make it easy to comfortable carry and transport our foldable bottle carrier around your home as well as to and from your car.✔ Our collapsible bottle case is also great for carrying Champagne and similarly sized beverage bottles.Take your favorite and most prized bottles of wine with you anywhere you go with our 12 Bottle Foldable Wine Carrier!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eB0MGQUQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAUTEROW","source_asin":"B09L2DHWD2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-220981","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L2DHWD2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L2DHWD2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
